    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it doesn't really feel like i'm part of a rhythm. it feels more like i'm just a glitch in the system. like, if i wasn't here, the math of the city stays exactly the same. there's no hole left behind. it just feels incredibly logical that someone this insignificant wouldn't really be missed. like there's no reason to keep fighting to be seen when it's clearly impossible.",
